 29	 ## Model families
 30	 
 31	 The crate detects the model family from the Bedrock model ID and routes capability flags accordingly:
 32	 
 33	 | Family | Examples | Structured output | Forced tool choice |
 34	 | --- | --- | --- | --- |
 35	-| `Anthropic` | `anthropic.claude-*`, `us.anthropic.*` | yes (forced-tool synthesis) | yes |
